---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import WhImage from '@components/WhImage.astro';
---
<Layout title="About" active="about" description="About Wayward House and Paul Hobson.">
  <section class="wh-wrap wh-section wh-about">
    <header class="wh-page-header">
      <span class="wh-kicker">About · Calgary, Alberta</span>
      <h1>Wayward House is a writing practice.</h1>
      <p class="wh-dek">Long-form essays, a weekly digest, and books on geography, mathematics, and the modern energy economy. Written from the prairie edge of the Rockies, in public, slowly.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="wh-about__grid">
      <div class="wh-about__copy">
        <h2>What's here</h2>
        <p><strong>Essays.</strong> Long pieces, edited carefully. No engagement loop, no hot takes. They are meant to be re-read.</p>
        <p><strong>System Signals.</strong> Once a week, plain-text email with a single signal worth attention.</p>
        <p><strong>Library.</strong> Books in progress on computational geography, mathematics, data engineering, and systems thinking. Each book is its own Quarto deploy.</p>

        <h2>Who's writing</h2>
        <p>Paul Hobson — half-baked engineer, geographer, and longtime maintainer of small open-source things. Trained in the wilds of Switzerland, New Mexico and tropical Norfolk, currently in Calgary.</p>

        <h2>The stack</h2>
        <p>This site is an Astro static build deployed to Cloudflare Pages. Books are Quarto projects deployed independently and routed under the apex domain. Search is Pagefind, indexed at build time.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="wh-about__photo">
        <WhImage id="pl-02" treatment="warm" ratio="3/4" />
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
